#!/bin/bash
#PBS -N Q1_RelExt
#PBS -P col772.cs1230848.course
#PBS -l select=1:ncpus=4:ngpus=1:centos=skylake
#PBS -l walltime=03:00:00

export PATH=/home/apps/centos7/JAX_MD/bin:$PATH
export HF_TOKEN="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"
export WANDB_DISABLED=true

cd /home/cse/btech/cs1230848/HPC-IIT-Delhi
python3 iitdproxy.py proxyAuth.txt &

BASE=/home/cse/btech/cs1230848/NLP_A3
cd "$BASE/Q1"

echo "====== Training Q1 ======"
bash train.sh ./output

echo "====== Generating val splits (seed=42, same as training) ======"
python -u "$BASE/make_val_splits.py" \
    --files "$BASE/sft_dataset/hi_train.jsonl" \
            "$BASE/sft_dataset/kn_train.jsonl" \
    --out_dir ./val_splits

echo "====== Inference Q1 ======"
bash infer.sh en  "$BASE/en_sft_dataset/valid.jsonl"  ./output
bash infer.sh hi  ./val_splits/hi_train_val.jsonl      ./output
bash infer.sh kn  ./val_splits/kn_train_val.jsonl      ./output

echo "====== Evaluation Q1 ======"
python -u "$BASE/eval.py" ./output/output_en.jsonl "$BASE/en_sft_dataset/valid.jsonl"
python -u "$BASE/eval.py" ./output/output_hi.jsonl ./val_splits/hi_train_val.jsonl
python -u "$BASE/eval.py" ./output/output_kn.jsonl ./val_splits/kn_train_val.jsonl

echo "====== Q1 Done ======"
